  84:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****      * to maxlen finishing up the hash computation, keeping only the
  85:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****      * correct result.
  86:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****      *
  87:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****      * Then we only need to compute HASH(okey + inner_hash) and we're done.
  88:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****      */
