 111:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****     /* Export MAC key
 112:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****      * We assume key length is always exactly the output size
