 477:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****  * Double the retransmit timeout value, within the allowed range,
 478:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****  * returning -1 if the maximum value has already been reached.
