 535:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c **** /* This functions transforms a (D)TLS plaintext fragment and a record content
 536:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****  * type into an instance of the (D)TLSInnerPlaintext structure. This is used
 537:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****  * in DTLS 1.2 + CID and within TLS 1.3 to allow flexible padding and to protect
 538:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****  * a record's content type.
