 548:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****  *               plaintext to be wrapped.
 549:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****  *  - `*content_size`: The length of the plaintext in Bytes.
 550:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****  *  - `max_len`: The number of Bytes available starting from
 551:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****  *               `content`. This must be `>= *content_size`.
 552:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****  *  - `rec_type`: The desired record content type.
 553:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****  *
 554:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****  *  Output:
 555:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****  *  - `content`: The beginning of the resulting (D)TLSInnerPlaintext structure.
 556:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****  *  - `*content_size`: The length of the resulting (D)TLSInnerPlaintext structure.
 557:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****  *
 558:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****  *  Returns:
 559:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****  *  - `0` on success.
