2213:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****         /*
2214:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****          * A record can't be split across datagrams. If we need to read but
