5404:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****     /*
5405:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_msg.c ****      * Case B: Further records are pending in the current datagram.
