 763:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                 If performing non-blocking I/O, \c MBEDTLS_ERR_SSL_WANT_WRITE
 764:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                 must be returned when the operation would block.
