 789:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  * \note           The callback may receive fewer bytes than the length of the
 790:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                 buffer. It must always return the number of bytes actually
 791:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                 received and written to the buffer.
 792:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  */
