 799:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *
 800:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  * \note           That callback must block until data is received, or the
 801:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                 timeout delay expires, or the operation is interrupted by a
