 902:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  * \param session_id_len  The length of \p session_id in Bytes.
 903:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  * \param session         The address of the session structure to populate.
