 905:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                        and the callback must always leave it in a state
 906:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                        where it can safely be freed via
