1134:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  * \brief           Callback type: cancel external operation.
1135:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *
1136:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                  This callback is called if an SSL connection is closed
