2040:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                  doesn't block, or one that handles timeouts, see
2041:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                  \c mbedtls_ssl_set_bio(). You also need to provide timer
