2573:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  * \brief           Set the certificate selection callback (server-side only).
2574:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *
2575:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                  If set, the callback is always called for each handshake,
