3698:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h **** /**
3699:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  * \brief          Set an opaque pre-shared Key (PSK) for the current handshake.
