3937:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  * \brief          Configure allowed signature algorithms for use in TLS
3938:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *
