3944:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                   used.
3945:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                 - For TLS 1.2, values should be given as
