4077:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                 If set, the ServerName callback is called whenever the
4078:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                 server receives a ServerName TLS extension from the client
4079:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                 during a handshake. The ServerName callback has the
4080:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                 following parameters: (void *parameter, mbedtls_ssl_context *ssl,
4081:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                 const unsigned char *hostname, size_t len). If a suitable
4082:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                 certificate is found, the callback must set the
4083:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/ssl.h ****  *                 certificate(s) and key(s) to use with \c
